{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0044_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b18decac086bc362426d4126f733603dcb1b55e8c51ff71bca8d1c0cfca21ae9", "ja": "（……うう、もうこんな時間か。イベントの準備やら\nなにやらが忙しくて、昼食を食べる時間がなかったな）", "zh": "（……呜呜，已经这么晚了啊。\n忙着准备活动跟其他事，都没时间吃午餐了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0044_1001_019min", "source_sha256": "80371e3fc74ce92f9545c76c8b60aaa3b68bb52d155f99a6d40cb72df1d2114b", "ja": "わっほ～い、{$P$}さん！\nお疲れさまです♪", "zh": "哇哦～{$P$}先生！\n你辛苦了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0044_1002_p", "source_sha256": "089611431d8318b2ec94984dd38f4b606774a3d08bcccff9bb48bda0ccf7918d", "ja": "お疲れ様、美奈子！　お昼は別行動になって\nしまったが、美奈子は、ちゃんと休憩とれたか？", "zh": "辛苦啦，美奈子！\n中午我们分头行动了，美奈子你有好好休息吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0044_1003_019min", "source_sha256": "45f24e8a68f7e077f01c98930b9a5082807847f41d3d1f72e35f8f9246a1bd4f", "ja": "はい、ちゃんと休みましたけど、美奈子は……って、\n{$P$}さんは休憩してないんですか？", "zh": "嗯，我是有好好休息……不过你会问我这个，\n就表示{$P$}先生没有休息吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0044_1004_p", "source_sha256": "2b0882bcf809ae33a61d2867e7bf7b632e2e0f877d4b4a11bf57ddb9d48f2f9c", "ja": "いや、まあ、そうだけど……でも大丈夫だから。", "zh": "这个，哎，是没错啦……但我没问题的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0044_1005_se", "source_sha256": "a7cc627e9677589fb40b09858fb7ea1c6c60cb81cadbb5e3d841ead8e95fdee9", "ja": "……グゥ～。", "zh": "……咕～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0044_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "c079221ea0aa1c6cd3343e8a698ba846d81f0ecbbb97a97d66c4fa727b742091", "ja": "あっ！　今……鳴りましたよね？\n{$P$}さんのおなか！", "zh": "啊！刚才……是不是叫出声来了？\n{$P$}先生的肚子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0044_1007_p", "source_sha256": "fdddc44dad810dafe57974c9a843172f54ae314c2de89e043294a453d43d54e4", "ja": "うっ、そ、そうだな……。", "zh": "呜，对、对啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0044_1008_019min", "source_sha256": "d01b2bac061778913568808a545474bc7eb1ef73461fb4f6c4d98d0e9bb47883", "ja": "全然大丈夫じゃないじゃないですか！？\nこれは、かつてない緊急事態ですよっ！", "zh": "哪里没问题，问题可大了啊！？\n这可是前所未有的紧急情况喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0044_1009_019min", "source_sha256": "b7df92bdd0938dbb8af8c24ab88efd0d4c6d2584c053a858460731e1cc22df24", "ja": "今、私、空き時間なので、お昼、作りますね！　どこか\nのお店のキッチンかカセットコンロを借りて……。", "zh": "我现在有空档，让我来帮你准备午餐吧！\n去找间店借用厨房或瓦斯炉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0044_1010_p", "source_sha256": "72d84e06b55a4d47232fbb41964f6522bf6251f9cb2612c69bea52974e4596f1", "ja": "そ、そこまでしなくていいって。何か軽めに\nつまめるお菓子か何か、買ってくるからさ。", "zh": "不、不用做到那个地步啦。\n我会去买点方便吃的小点心之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0044_1011_019min", "source_sha256": "78ac98ff702bb2f6a44c0640953f3965589533dd75a19232d6bde8bfdf46b418", "ja": "じゃあ、お菓子を作りますっ！\nチャーハンでいいですか？", "zh": "那我就帮你做点心！\n炒饭可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0044_1012_p", "source_sha256": "b459afde686a049c386c435b20d364ed6197ced84f8e212428ce4f65d0e6085d", "ja": "……ん？　ごめん、聞き間違いかな？\nお菓子を作るって言わなかったか？", "zh": "……嗯？抱歉，我是不是听错什么了？\n你不是说要做点心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0044_1013_019min", "source_sha256": "318d797640ccada4da7fbde7066016ac68c6264636389502132f231d464c2848", "ja": "え？　男の人にとっては、\nチャーハンってお菓子ですよね？", "zh": "咦？对男人而言，\n炒饭算是点心对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0044_1014_019min", "source_sha256": "bea0d38d3d9366b69f416c32b670155632d8ca97b3276997c08bffd4841d6246", "ja": "とにかく、パパッと作るので、待っててくださいね！\nこういう時に、遠慮はナシです♪", "zh": "总之我会马上完成的，等我一下喔！\n这种时候你就别客气了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0044_1015_p", "source_sha256": "f021ee03e7598d0970c343b212beddf44f7aceb8e03e27481b4a2a2f87d79310", "ja": "（チャーハンは主食だと思うが……美奈子の勢いに\n負けて、なんとなく押し切られてしまった）", "zh": "（我想炒饭应该算是主食啦……但因为败在\n美奈子的气势之下，我也只好顺着她的意了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_019min0044_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_019min0044_1016_p", "source_sha256": "3b991213d856a081211341b63e6e75b42ec6828ae4059d8672af60fe689108d4", "ja": "（でもせっかくの申し出だし、チャーハンは、いただく\nことにするかな。ありがとう、美奈子……！）", "zh": "（不过她都特地说要准备了，\n我就好好享用炒饭吧。谢谢你，美奈子……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
